{"seq":4,"slug":"machine-learning","title":"机器学习基础","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":6,"docCount":25,"url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning","rating":{"composite":3.83,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.9,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4}},"introMarkdown":"# 机器学习基础 简介\n\n机器学习是人工智能的核心分支，它赋予计算机从数据中自动学习规律并做出预测或决策的能力，而无需被显式编程。从推荐系统到自动驾驶，从医学影像诊断到自然语言处理，机器学习正在深刻重塑各个行业的技术范式。本手册系统性地覆盖了机器学习从理论基础到工程落地的完整知识体系，帮助开发者建立扎实的机器学习技术素养。\n\n本手册面向具备基本编程能力和线性代数、概率统计基础知识的开发者。如果你已经熟悉基本的数据操作和数学运算，那么你已经具备了学习机器学习的前提条件。无论你是希望转型 AI 方向的前端或后端工程师，还是准备深入理解底层原理的算法初学者，都能从本手册中获得系统化的知识框架。\n\n第一章**基础**从机器学习的全景视角出发，建立核心认知。我们将介绍机器学习的基本范式——监督学习与无监督学习的定义、区别和典型应用场景，以及评估模型好坏的核心指标体系。这些基础概念是理解后续所有章节的理论基石。\n\n第二章**经典算法**系统讲解机器学习中最经典且应用最广泛的算法家族。从线性回归和逻辑回归的数学直觉，到决策树的信息增益与剪枝策略，再到 SVM 的核技巧和集成方法的 Boosting/Bagging 思想——掌握这些经典算法不仅能解决大量实际问题，更能为理解深度学习打下坚实基础。\n\n第三章**神经网络**从感知机出发，逐步构建对深度学习的完整理解。多层网络的前向传播与反向传播算法揭示了神经网络学习的核心机制；卷积神经网络（CNN）展示了如何高效提取空间特征；循环神经网络（RNN）与 LSTM 则解决了序列数据建模的难题，本章同时梳理了从 RNN 到 Transformer 的架构演进——神经网络是通向现代 AI 的必经之路。\n\n第四章**训练与优化**聚焦于如何让模型更好地学习。损失函数定义了优化的目标，梯度下降系列算法提供了参数更新的策略，正则化技术防止模型过拟合，超参数调优则在巨大的搜索空间中寻找最佳配置——训练过程的质量直接决定了模型的最终表现。\n\n第五章**特征工程**探讨数据层面的优化艺术。数据预处理将原始数据转化为模型可消费的格式，特征选择和降维从高维空间中提炼关键信息，数据增强则在样本有限时有效扩充训练集——业界有句名言\"数据和特征决定了模型的上限，算法只是逼近这个上限\"。\n\n第六章**部署**将训练好的模型推向生产环境。模型序列化实现了训练与推理的解耦，CoreML 和 ONNX 提供了跨平台模型转换的标准方案，LiteRT（原 TFLite）与 llama.cpp 等栈支撑从移动端小模型到端侧大语言模型的推理，MLOps 与 LLMOps 则将模型的持续训练、部署和监控纳入工程化流程——从实验室到产品的最后一公里，部署能力决定了机器学习项目的实际价值。\n\n建议按照章节顺序循序渐进地学习：先夯实基础概念，再掌握经典算法，然后深入神经网络，接着理解训练优化技巧，之后学习特征工程的实践方法，最后掌握模型部署的工程能力。本手册的目标是帮助你建立从理论到实践的完整机器学习知识体系，在面对真实问题时能够选择合适的算法、设计有效的特征、训练高质量的模型并将其可靠地部署到生产环境。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":4,"url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ml-overview","title":"机器学习概览","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/foundations/ml-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"supervised-learning","title":"监督学习","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/foundations/supervised-learning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"unsupervised-learning","title":"无监督学习","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/foundations/unsupervised-learning"},{"seq":4,"slug":"evaluation-metrics","title":"评估指标","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/foundations/evaluation-metrics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"classical-algorithms","title":"经典算法","docCount":5,"url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/classical-algorithms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"linear-regression","title":"线性回归","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/classical-algorithms/linear-regression"},{"seq":2,"slug":"logistic-regression","title":"逻辑回归","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/classical-algorithms/logistic-regression"},{"seq":3,"slug":"decision-trees","title":"决策树","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/classical-algorithms/decision-trees"},{"seq":4,"slug":"svm-and-kernel","title":"SVM 与核方法","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/classical-algorithms/svm-and-kernel"},{"seq":5,"slug":"ensemble-methods","title":"集成方法","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/classical-algorithms/ensemble-methods"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"neural-networks","title":"神经网络","docCount":4,"url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/neural-networks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"perceptron-and-mlp","title":"感知机与多层网络","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/neural-networks/perceptron-and-mlp"},{"seq":2,"slug":"backpropagation","title":"反向传播","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/neural-networks/backpropagation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cnn-basics","title":"CNN 基础","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/neural-networks/cnn-basics"},{"seq":4,"slug":"rnn-and-lstm","title":"RNN 与 LSTM","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/neural-networks/rnn-and-lstm"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"training-and-optimization","title":"训练与优化","docCount":4,"url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/training-and-optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"loss-functions","title":"损失函数","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/training-and-optimization/loss-functions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gradient-descent","title":"梯度下降","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/training-and-optimization/gradient-descent"},{"seq":3,"slug":"regularization","title":"正则化","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/training-and-optimization/regularization"},{"seq":4,"slug":"hyperparameter-tuning","title":"超参数调优","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/training-and-optimization/hyperparameter-tuning"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"feature-engineering","title":"特征工程","docCount":4,"url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/feature-engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-preprocessing","title":"数据预处理","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/feature-engineering/data-preprocessing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"feature-selection","title":"特征选择","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/feature-engineering/feature-selection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dimensionality-reduction","title":"降维","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/feature-engineering/dimensionality-reduction"},{"seq":4,"slug":"data-augmentation","title":"数据增强","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/feature-engineering/data-augmentation"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"deployment","title":"部署","docCount":4,"url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/deployment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"model-serialization","title":"模型序列化","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/deployment/model-serialization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"coreml-and-onnx","title":"CoreML 与 ONNX","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/deployment/coreml-and-onnx"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tflite-mobile","title":"TFLite 移动端部署","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/deployment/tflite-mobile"},{"seq":4,"slug":"mlops-basics","title":"MLOps 基础","url":"/h/ai-llm/machine-learning/deployment/mlops-basics"}]}]}